    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wondered what happens up there in the Red laboratory?<br />\r\nFor years the head of the family had been working on his secret project, a formula for scouring the world with true horror.<br />\r\nTo transform the Reds\u2026 into monstrous creatures!<br />\r\nBut the fire of hope never stops burning: The fight to regain the humanity of them all has just begun.<br />\r\nChoose your Red and pepare to battle! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRedrum is a 1v1 arcade party game.<br />\r\nDuring Halloween night, the Reds were transformed into horrific creatures with peculiar powers.<br />\r\nThe clashes take place inside the rooms of Red Manior, which will become real arenas in the clashes between the 16 members of the Red family. <br />\r\nFight until the last second as you try to collect (or steal) as many ingredients as possible for the antidote needed to reverse the transformation!<br />\r\nAttack your opponent like hell, or escape with the ingredients and use the environment to hide from him, in this fun game that follows the &quot;easy to learn, hard to perform&quot; philosophy!",
